@startuml
[*] --> Created : User creates an account
Created --> Watching Videos : User watches videos after creating an account
Watching Videos --> Uploading Video : User uploads video
Uploading Video --> Watching Videos : User returns to watching videos after uploading
Watching Videos --> Viewing Likes List : User saves video to likes list during video viewing
Viewing Likes List --> Watching Videos : User views saved videos from likes list
Watching Videos --> In Discussion : User enters discussion option
In Discussion --> [*] : User exits discussion option
@enduml
